data.value:
Restore saves from {0:g}?

{1}

Owned servers will stop. Automatic backup is {2}. Source, client and login keys stay as selected; an older save may need its original revision.

Copy the complete standalone PoE 3.29.3b installation to: {0}
1. In File Explorer, open the supported client folder containing Content.ggpk and PathOfExile.exe (or Game.exe). 2. Press Ctrl+A, then Ctrl+C to copy; do not move your normal installation. 3. Open the selected checkout in another File Explorer window. Create its Client folder if missing, open it, then press Ctrl+V. 4. Wait for the copy to finish. Return to Setup and click Prepare local client.
Steam layout and a newer official client are unsupported. The launcher does not download the game.

Restore saved mod enable/disable choices from {0:g}?

{1}

This replaces the saved choices only. Mod DLLs and saves are not restored. The choices take effect at the next Gateway start. Automatic backup is {2}.
